oductionhome2022-hash/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Deep audit follow-up — member store title fulfillment\n\nThis isolated change addresses a concrete gap found during the Phase 1/2 deep audit.\n\n### Implemented\n- Added the trusted `setMemberCustomTitle` callable. It requires a completed active member account and a live `title_custom` entitlement, validates a 2–40 character title, writes only the member-owned custom title, and records a profile audit event.\n- Updated the profile projection to expose the member's custom title only while the matching entitlement remains active. Expired/revoked entitlements fall back to the catalog title.\n- Added a member-facing title editor that appears only for the profile owner with the active title entitlement.\n- Expanded the premium-profile emulator integration test for successful customization, missing entitlement denial, and invalid-length rejection.\n\n### Validation boundary\n- This PR does not alter the accepted local-biometric reward trust model; the backend still records that the 30-day/1,500-coin award follows a client-reported native OS prompt, not civil identity verification or cryptographic proof of biometric success.\n- Android/iOS native project directories are absent from the current development tree, so native build/device acceptance remains open.\n- No production deployment or merge to `main` is included.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-14T09:18:36Z","updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:11:25Z","closed_at":"2026-11-14T09:22:45Z","merged_at":"2026-11-14T09:22:45Z","merge_commit_sha":"4ed7394235ea531e4b4abbb24431731da15eaf47","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"productionhome2022-hash:codex/mawd